### ------------------------------------------------------------
### Contacts API - REST Client test file
### Use the "Send Request" link above each request (VS Code REST Client)
### ------------------------------------------------------------

@localUrl = http://localhost:8081/contacts
@renderUrl = https://cse341-003-web-services.onrender.com

### ===================== LOCAL =====================

### Get all contacts (local)
GET http://localhost:8081/contacts/6ab3eba2ddb8420a964f7d2d

### Get contact by id (local) - replace the id with a real _id from MongoDB
GET http://localhost:8081/contacts/6ab3eba2ddb8420a964f7d2e

### Create a new contact (local) - returns the new contact id
POST http://localhost:8081/contacts/6ab3eba2ddb8420a964f7d2d
Content-Type: application/json

{
   "firstName": "John",
    "lastName": "Doe",
    "email": "johndoe@test.com",
    "favoriteColor": "Blue",
    "birthday": "1990-01-01"
}

### Update a contact (local) - replace the id with the one returned by POST
PUT http://localhost:8081/contacts/6ab3eba2ddb8420a964f7d2d
Content-Type: application/json

{
   "firstName": "John",
    "lastName": "Doe",
    "email": "johndoe@test.com",
    "favoriteColor": "Blue",
    "birthday": "1990-01-01"
}

### Delete a contact (local)
DELETE {{localUrl}}/contacts/<CONTACT_ID>

### ===================== RENDER =====================

### Get all contacts (Render)
GET {{renderUrl}}/contacts

### Get contact by id (Render) - replace the id with a real _id from MongoDB
GET {{renderUrl}}/contacts/<CONTACT_ID>

### Create a new contact (Render) - returns the new contact id
POST {{renderUrl}}/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
   "firstName": "John",
    "lastName": "Doe",
    "email": "johndoe@test.com",
    "favoriteColor": "Blue",
    "birthday": "1990-01-01"
}

### Update a contact (Render) - replace the id with the one returned by POST
PUT {{renderUrl}}/contacts/<CONTACT_ID>
Content-Type: application/json

{
   "firstName": "John",
    "lastName": "Doe",
    "email": "johndoe@test.com",
    "favoriteColor": "Blue",
    "birthday": "1990-01-01"
}

### Delete a contact (Render)
DELETE {{renderUrl}}/contacts/<CONTACT_ID>
